title Генерация сигналов (M8)\n@version M8.v1
autonumber


Scheduler -> Signals: generate(series, signal_type)
Signals -> DB: resolveOrCreate(signal_params)
Signals -> DB: read signal_checkpoint or coverage.start
loop по барам LTF (ASC)
Signals -> DB: read indicator values (LTF) needed
Signals -> DB: read HTF indicators (last closed ≤ ts)
Signals -> Signals: apply rules, debounce/cooldown
alt passed + not filtered
Signals -> DB: INSERT signal_event {direction,score,reason}
else filtered/debounced
Signals -> DB: INSERT signal_event {is_filter=true,reason} (по политике)
end
end
Signals -> DB: upsert signal_checkpoint
Signals -> Metrics: signal_events_total++


note over Signals
Без look-ahead; score ∈ [-1..+1];\n
reason — структурный JSON (объяснимость)
end note
